        <h1>Van Recovery Aberdeen</h1>
        <p class="page-hero__lede">A van off the road is lost working time. We recover vans and light commercial vehicles across Aberdeen and Aberdeenshire, taking them straight to a garage or depot of your choosing.</p>
        <div class="hero__actions" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
